 
 .html : Extension
 ctrl + / for making line comment
 <> </> : tags
 ! + Enter : for creating boilerplate code
 Alt + z : for wrapping the code
 ctrl + d : for selecting the same word
 shift + alt + f : for formatting the code
 shift + alt + arrow keys :  duplicating
attribute : property of tag which gives additional information about the tag <lang = en> or <class = "container"> or <id = "main">
<P>lorem</P> : paragraph tag
